WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.430
This thing is a Kishin?

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.020
Its head is missing...

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.430
We finally get here 
and it's already been slain?

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:12.360
No... I think it's still alive.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.320
What do you mean, Tsugumi?

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.930
Well, when an oni dies, 
it's supposed to turn into Kitetsu.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.200
Since it hasn't yet, 
its horn is probably still intact.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.320
I see.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.320
What're you doing?

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.940
I know Musashi's going to
 join back up with us.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.580
I want to find the Kishin's weakness 
so we'll be ready when he does.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.410
Kojiro...

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.010
Any protrusions that could be the horn?

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.200
<b>A Bushi's Way of Life</b>

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:20.210
I haven't seen anything.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:24.270
Maybe it's on the head, 
since that seems to be missing.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.510
Exactly right!

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:26.410
Who's there?!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.090
Are you the one who took 
this Kishin's head?

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:33.190
Yep!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:37.120
Where's the head with the horn?

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.590
Hey! Are you listening?

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.660
Where'd you hide the head?!

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.840
Hey... Answer me, damn you!

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.510
Best to just tell us where 
the Kishin's head is.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.120
Then my band will take the kill!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.860
Come on now... Is this really the time
for Bushi to be fighting with each other?

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:16.120
I'm here for your Kitetsu Blades.

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:21.080
And that means you're all 
going to have to die!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.130
Are you one of those sword hunters?!

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.360
A sword hunter?!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:30.760
You have to kill the wielder of a 
Kitetsu Blade to steal its power!

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:34.210
You filthy animal! If that's what 
you're after, then bring it on!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.490
Take this!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.910
I love it when the materials put up a fight!

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.690
Wh-What is this?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:12.810
His strength... It's obscene!

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.760
He's no ordinary sword-hunting bandit!

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.130
What do we do, Kojiro?!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.120
Get back!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.330
Kojiro?

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:26.040
Oh, then you're the one?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:29.030
What?! Do you know me?

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.450
A Bushi's death is a glorious thing.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.780
Even when your body's gone, 
your soul inhabits your Kitetsu Blade...

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:40.580
You become one with your sword 
and go on fighting forever.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.330
What are you on about?

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.200
That redhead...

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.310
You mean Musashi?

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:52.020
He's already a Kitetsu Blade. 
And he's waiting for you.

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:54.020
Musashi's a Kitetsu Blade?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.480
What did you do to him?!

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.640
I can do the same for you!

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:59.190
Isn't that exciting?!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.290
<i>Musashi!</i>

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:11.160
<i>I... What happened to me?</i>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.670
<i>You've turned into black stone.</i>

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.710
<i>Black stone?</i>

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:21.870
<i>That's right.</i>

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.200
<i>You don't need to fight anymore.</i>

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.930
<i>Stay here and hide forever.</i>

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.700
<i>I don't want you to die.</i>

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:44.270
<i>I thought you'd be safe in the magma...</i>

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.590
<i>But it seems they can still 
reach us even here.</i>

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:52.770
<i>It's all over. We're going to be caught.</i>

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.300
<i>Such a shame...</i>

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.610
<i>Wait! Who are you?!</i>

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:19.760
That's the kid who failed 
the sword trial, right?

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:20.870
He's alive!

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:28.120
Huh? You're still alive?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:31.230
I thought you would've 
turned to stone by now...

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.140
Haven't we met before?

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:34.570
I'm Nanao.

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:38.570
And reeling you out was... 
a miscalculation, you could say.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:42.150
I wanted to finish our mission 
to retrieve the goddess,

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:47.960
but it seems I pulled you out of the pit 
before you completely turned to black stone.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.550
Also, please put some clothes on.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.500
Pulled me out of the pit?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.340
This is...

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.650
where I fell.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.490
I'm back?

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.290
I'm back...

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.400
<i>We'll turn your friends into 
material for my swords, too!</i>

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.100
That's right! I gotta go!

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:13.080
Thanks for hauling me up!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.050
You really don't have to thank me...

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.750
Kojiro and Tsugumi are in danger!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.430
<i>Kojiro! Tsugumi!</i>

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.030
<i>You won't be able to do 
anything even if you go.</i>

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:26.510
<i>You don't have the strength to fight.</i>

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.420
<i>You would only get in the way.</i>

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.230
<i>You say you want to be a Bushi,</i>

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:34.780
<i>but that's just an excuse to be 
with your friends, isn't it?</i>

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.140
You don't get it.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:43.300
To me, being a Bushi is way more than that!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.690
<b>The remaining Bushi</b>

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.690
The remaining Bushi...

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:52.130
<b>should just die</b>

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.200
should just die.

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.750
Very good! Well said, Musashi.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.710
<i>No...</i>

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:17.340
<i>I'm the one who should die.</i>

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:32.060
What am I doing here?

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.960
An apology won't make up for it...

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.160
Musashi?

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.010
Pops?

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:46.920
Pops, I'm so sorry about what I said!

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.560
It's cold out there.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.940
You should come in and warm up.

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:07.680
<i>I'm the worst. It hurts so bad
 to be told to die...</i>

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.660
<i>I know that better than 
anyone, and I still...</i>

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.860
<i>There's no point in me being alive!</i>

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:18.290
Musashi, don't worry about 
what happened today.

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.320
I know you're in a tough position right now.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.690
And it's because you're friends 
with a Bushi family like ours.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:31.790
But you and Kojiro haven't 
done anything wrong!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:36.250
You've always always thought 
that way about us, haven't you?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.400
<i>That was super cool!</i>

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:51.020
Kojiro was alone before he met you.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:56.530
The entire town treated him coldly, 
just like they treat you now.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.040
He was on the verge of breaking...

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:03.430
Just like me...?

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:06.810
Musashi...

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.940
You saved Kojiro.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:15.150
Having a friend to laugh and cry with...

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:17.760
Someone he could support 
and be supported by...

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.170
It humanized him.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:23.170
And that made me happier than anything.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:28.010
Musashi, you're an amazing boy.

00:10:28.010 --> 00:10:30.630
You've saved two people's hearts.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.600
Kojiro and I owe you a great deal.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.450
Thank you.

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:40.150
So don't ever think that you're worthless!

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.360
I want you to live.

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:45.880
Stay alive and keep on living, Musashi!

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:52.810
Okay!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:08.810
Do you want to live here?

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.530
Pops!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:22.610
<i>Pops took me in and raised me.</i>

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.820
Don't worry about it.

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:30.180
I'm just living the way I want,
 like a Bushi should.

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.290
Like a Bushi should?

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:35.910
You swear loyalty to whatever you 
cherish and gives you strength,

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:37.520
then live without ever betraying that.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.640
That's the Bushi way of life.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.350
The Bushi way of life!

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:52.910
<i>Pops! You were a Bushi, 
and you kept my soul from dying!</i>

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.840
<i>That's why...</i>

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:58.500
I'm gonna follow the same path
 without betraying it!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.650
You mustn't run away. 
You mustn't run away.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.750
Didn't I tell you clowns to stop running?!

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.260
That monster...

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.910
He's as strong as a Kishin.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:21.150
The souls of cowards are hideous!

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.170
Bushi like that only turn 
into dull wastes of steel.

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.350
That's not what I'm looking for!

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:32.790
But y'know, even if that's not my style,

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.440
I'd better make the redhead's 
friend into material.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.600
I made a promise, after all!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.450
No! He's coming right for us!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.160
He really is after me!

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:49.420
Kojiro?! Where are you going?!

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:53.990
I'm over here, you crazy bastard!

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:56.500
Is he trying to help the rest of us flee?!
 That's crazy!

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:09.310
A dead end...

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.460
Dammit!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.650
I'm not going to die like this.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:31.290
I can't hit him at all!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:33.490
Here we go...

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.240
It's no use... I don't stand a chance.

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.030
That was very brave of you.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.340
I like people who've got real guts!

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:02.300
The souls of courageous Bushi 
are a beautiful color...

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.480
<i>I-I'm done for...</i>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.210
Kojiro!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.350
<i>Why did he stop?</i>

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:19.950
Musashi!

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.170
What? Musashi?

00:14:23.810 --> 00:14:27.820
Isn't that the kid who 
failed his sword trial?

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.290
What's he trying to do?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.140
Musashi...

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.110
Musashi!

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:53.500
Kojiro, Tsugumi!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.580
I...

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:58.550
You what?

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.200
Uh, I'm back.

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:06.660
Took you long enough.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.280
You okay, Kojiro?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:10.800
That guy almost got him.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.920
You look pretty messed up too.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.630
What's with the outfit?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.810
A Kitetsu Blade...?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.780
Musashi, can you use Kitetsu Blades now?!

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.120
That's awesome!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:33.940
Wait, you still can't?!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:37.870
Well, I'm still not getting 
the cool light show...

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:43.450
But that haze and those black stones aren't 
coming out of me when I grab one now.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:46.660
So... what does that mean?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:52.730
Neither accepted 
nor rejected by the blade, hmm?

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.560
Master.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.920
What's the meaning of this, Nanao?

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.740
Why's the redhead still alive?

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:05.140
Turns out I pulled him up too early 
when he was turning to black stone.

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.820
My, that was careless.

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.690
You were probably in a hurry to 
finish the job, weren't you?

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.560
You slacker!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:14.730
Why, of course not. Don't be silly, Master.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:19.580
I was just overzealous in pursuit 
of our glorious mission.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.960
Well, I forgive you!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.730
Because things have gotten interesting.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:26.790
What do you mean?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.820
Look at him. He's halfway 
fused with the black stone.

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.910
The goddess hasn't cast her judgment yet.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.790
Which means...

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:41.990
If we attack him here now, 
the goddess will issue her sentence.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:44.400
And we'll get to see it happen!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:48.850
Just how bad is this going to be?
 I can't wait to find out!

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:54.560
Understood. Resuming goddess 
retrieval operation.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.230
I just need to kill 
the redheaded host boy, right?

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:02.830
Now there's two of them...

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.450
What's their problem with me?!

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:09.400
Nah. I think I'm the one 
they're trying to kill.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.430
So <i>you're</i> the one in danger?

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:15.380
And you can't even use a Kitetsu Blade! 
Why'd you come here for?!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.940
What do you mean?

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.590
I came because I knew you 
guys were in trouble.

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:24.080
Besides, Bushi fight together.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.220
Right, Kojiro?

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.380
I bet Bushi fight together with their friends!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.600
With their friends?

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.360
I like the sound of that.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.750
Okay, we're gonna do it too, Kojiro!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:36.630
Yeah!

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.240
<i>Together, huh?</i>

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:45.160
<i>Even if you have a sword,
fighting alone doesn't mean much.</i>

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.570
<i>When you take a stand,
it should be alongside someone.</i>

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:49.710
<i></i>For<i> someone.</i>

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:52.960
<i>But not just some random person.</i>

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.140
<i>And it doesn't matter who's in charge!</i>

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.270
<i>This guy... Musashi...</i>

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:00.760
<i>He said he wants to fight by my side!</i>

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:03.010
<i>He's always said that.</i>

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.140
All right.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:05.980
Whoa!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:06.850
No way, no how!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.780
They're too strong!

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:12.320
Besides, aren't we here
 to fight oni and not other Bushi?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.420
But they're after us.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:18.620
If we run, then someone else 
might get hurt in the process.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.400
Kojiro, you're not trash.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:25.810
You're the descendant of a proud, 
courageous bloodline.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:30.200
I want to be able to face 
my dad with pride!

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.240
Y-You do...?

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:36.190
We're also doing this to protect 
people who are weaker than us.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:38.650
That's the Bushi way, Tsugumi.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.440
Tsubame...

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.510
Moreover, they're Bushi, too.

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:46.650
How lame would it make us 
if we turned tail and ran?

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:52.030
We're forming the strongest 
band ever, aren't we?

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:57.580
The three of us are gonna work together...

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.670
and find a way out of this!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.060
Right!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:08.180
My master tends to amuse himself 
in a very wasteful fashion.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.000
So I'll be the one to take your lives.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.750
Her staff came apart!

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.410
My Kitetsu Blade...

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.230
Seven Belled Armadillo Sword!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.340
That sword!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.050
One, two, three...

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.210
Seven blades?!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:41.090
Have a taste of my sword skills!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:43.300
Seven Lashing Swords Style 
secret technique...

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.160
Mangling Murder Wheel!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.670
A style with seven swords 
has to be cheating!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:56.760
Even if you dodge one, the rest keep coming!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:00.880
Just give up. Nobody likes a sore loser!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:08.180
There you go, Nanao!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:11.650
I'll be expecting 
a big reward for this, Master.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.020
<i>Her technique might be awesome,</i>

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.240
<i>but she's no oni.</i>

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:20.660
<i>I can take her even with a regular sword!</i>

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:25.070
That means I can actually fight this time!

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.330
One! Two! Three!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.000
And four!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.510
She's too far away! In that case...

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.340
With the earth itself acting as a scabbard,

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.940
you draw a flying spiral 
to cleave apart demons.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.900
Kanemaki-Isshin Style 
sword-drawing technique...

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:55.900
What's this?

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:59.390
Thousand Vortex Shredder!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.320
What?!

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:15.030
Musashi!

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.820
Dammit, I was so close...

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.330
I don't think you were!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:27.890
How are we supposed to beat her 
if we can't even reach her?

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.840
<i>We can't reach her?</i>

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:32.880
<i>We're just getting her blades...</i>

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:37.010
Hey, what if we smash all 
seven of her swords?

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.860
I see. You want to sunder her weapon.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:41.870
Not a bad idea.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:45.110
Yeah, but how exactly is 
this gonna work, Captain?

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.810
Musashi, Tsugumi...

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:53.530
I've got a plan.

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:27.700
I messed up again today...

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:33.010
<b>Surprisingly klutzy</b>

00:23:28.120 --> 00:23:30.410
I pulled the redhead up too soon,

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.530
and the second I took my eyes off him, 
he thanked me and ran off.

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:37.020
<b>Waits for directions</b>

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:35.530
You should've just waited instead.

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:37.200
That way, someone else could handle it.

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:39.960
I get the feeling it's a bad idea
to leave them to their own devices.

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Time
The Goddess's Power</b>
